    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/159282eb3952b092c7ea3975fdf24d23.avif?t=1753275230\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries of living in darkness have robbed your tribe of sight, but in return, you have gained extraordinary hearing. After a tragic turning point in your tribe\u2019s history, you must venture into uncharted caverns filled with monstrous threats. Armed only with a whip and your ability to &quot;see&quot; through sound, you must fight, navigate, and survive in this treacherous new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/5d0b3a12aa3de0fd0f4c0096ca82b934.avif?t=1753275230\" width=615 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/2ad38fa34c2a41603fe65652fd8d3667.poster.avif?t=1753275230\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/2ad38fa34c2a41603fe65652fd8d3667.webm?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/2ad38fa34c2a41603fe65652fd8d3667.mp4?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate pitch-black environments by generating sound waves that reveal your surroundings. Every movement, crack of your whip, or environmental noise helps you visualize the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/55cf102a71203c9c1078136639617116.avif?t=1753275230\" width=615 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/43e84f05298e0a904e8322759f8aeafb.poster.avif?t=1753275230\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/43e84f05298e0a904e8322759f8aeafb.webm?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/43e84f05298e0a904e8322759f8aeafb.mp4?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave's twisting tunnels, towering chasms, and shifting paths can disorient even seasoned explorers. To avoid getting lost, you'll need to draw your own map\u2014or risk wandering in circles forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/2ef0b8bf3a7d07b14f069bffc1e6d651.avif?t=1753275230\" width=615 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/c5399990e62680c8b14144d8552a9617.poster.avif?t=1753275230\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/c5399990e62680c8b14144d8552a9617.webm?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/c5399990e62680c8b14144d8552a9617.mp4?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While sound is your greatest asset, too much noise can overwhelm your senses. Use your whip wisely, or risk temporary deafness in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/6c5493328f0e26902551e7ce1a429466.avif?t=1753275230\" width=615 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/7bdb11498e6578a009c9e0c3d782d4b8.poster.avif?t=1753275230\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/7bdb11498e6578a009c9e0c3d782d4b8.webm?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/7bdb11498e6578a009c9e0c3d782d4b8.mp4?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your whip isn't just a weapon; it's a tool for traversal. Swing across chasms, disarm enemies, and strike with precision to gain the upper hand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/159282eb3952b092c7ea3975fdf24d23.avif?t=1753275230\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Centuries of living in darkness have robbed your tribe of sight, but in return, you have gained extraordinary hearing. After a tragic turning point in your tribe\u2019s history, you must venture into uncharted caverns filled with monstrous threats. Armed only with a whip and your ability to &quot;see&quot; through sound, you must fight, navigate, and survive in this treacherous new world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/5d0b3a12aa3de0fd0f4c0096ca82b934.avif?t=1753275230\" width=615 height=55 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/2ad38fa34c2a41603fe65652fd8d3667.poster.avif?t=1753275230\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/2ad38fa34c2a41603fe65652fd8d3667.webm?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/2ad38fa34c2a41603fe65652fd8d3667.mp4?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate pitch-black environments by generating sound waves that reveal your surroundings. Every movement, crack of your whip, or environmental noise helps you visualize the world around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/55cf102a71203c9c1078136639617116.avif?t=1753275230\" width=615 height=56 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/43e84f05298e0a904e8322759f8aeafb.poster.avif?t=1753275230\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/43e84f05298e0a904e8322759f8aeafb.webm?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/43e84f05298e0a904e8322759f8aeafb.mp4?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cave's twisting tunnels, towering chasms, and shifting paths can disorient even seasoned explorers. To avoid getting lost, you'll need to draw your own map\u2014or risk wandering in circles forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/2ef0b8bf3a7d07b14f069bffc1e6d651.avif?t=1753275230\" width=615 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/c5399990e62680c8b14144d8552a9617.poster.avif?t=1753275230\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/c5399990e62680c8b14144d8552a9617.webm?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/c5399990e62680c8b14144d8552a9617.mp4?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While sound is your greatest asset, too much noise can overwhelm your senses. Use your whip wisely, or risk temporary deafness in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/6c5493328f0e26902551e7ce1a429466.avif?t=1753275230\" width=615 height=55 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/7bdb11498e6578a009c9e0c3d782d4b8.poster.avif?t=1753275230\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/7bdb11498e6578a009c9e0c3d782d4b8.webm?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3388080/extras/7bdb11498e6578a009c9e0c3d782d4b8.mp4?t=1753275230\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your whip isn't just a weapon; it's a tool for traversal. Swing across chasms, disarm enemies, and strike with precision to gain the upper hand.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2>",
